        Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\\n      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\\n  -v, --version                  version for task-board\\n\\nUse \\\"task-board [command] --help\\\" for more information about a command.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3108,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 777,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
